Episode: uPAR CAR T — an intravenous CAR T cell that never enters the brain reverses cognitive aging by deleting the uPAR+ inflammatory bone marrow myeloid progenitors that seed inflamed border-associated macrophages (Amor lab, CSHL/HHMI); intrathecal reads out at 2.5 months and IV at 6, one prophylactic dose holds 16 months, PS19 median survival +37.8%, and a progenitor transplant with equal engraftment and equal brain myeloid influx separates fate from trafficking
